                            CategoryId = 2,
                            CreatedAt = new DateTime(2026, 10, 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, DateTimeKind.Utc),
                            Description = "A thrilling journey begins aboard a yacht owned by a ruthless man named Mike Russell, where captives from a mysterious island are being held.\nAmid the fog and darkness, Adam — a stranger from across the seas — decides to risk everything to set them free, aided by the bold young girl, Rayhan.\nBut escape is only the beginning...\nConflict soon erupts between the greedy invader seeking domination and the steadfast guardians of the island, while Adam struggles to master his powers and accept the pivotal role he must play in facing the looming threat.\n\nMeanwhile, Manuela, Mike’s daughter, pursues her own agenda with the help of scientist Claudia, where scientific breakthroughs intertwine with a dangerous game of hidden interests.\nAs events escalate, all find themselves standing at the brink of a decisive confrontation, where no one knows who will survive, and who will be swept away by the storm",
                            ImageUrl = "/images/products/9789778203011.webp",
