                            CategoryId = 7,
                            CreatedAt = new DateTime(2026, 10, 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, DateTimeKind.Utc),
                            Description = "Jerusalem is not merely a city—it is a confluence of spiritual, national, and cultural dimensions, interwoven with historical and existential significance. It is not merely a holy city revered through the ages but a divine and universal message, a living testament to history that reaches into the depths of time. Jerusalem is inseparable from Palestine—its land, its people, and its enduring Arab identity.",
